			"category_id": 2519,
			"title": "Secret Portal",
			"description": "**Difficulty:** ★★★★★\n\n**Boss:** [Hockomonkey](#loc=75328)\n\nNote: Secret Portals are all super-powered versions of bosses from the game's plot. See the boss' map marker for strategies.",
